  "2026-10-20T17:04:07.768Z",codex-agent,Long-history self-review found receipt eviction order retained old ancestors ahead of recent tips after the 4096-boundary limit. Reversed insertion order so a fully verified tip remains a boundary for subsequent publications even above the limit. Strengthened the 4097-change regression to require zero warm-tip visits and independent revalidation of the evicted oldest boundary. Initial full gate runs were intentionally stopped before completion to include this correction; neither had reported a test failure. Both full gates will restart on the corrected committed source. Native Bun acceptance in a real non-Git tracker passed 1/1 for cached verification and scheduled-revocation refusal.
