  "2026-10-20T17:06:11.566Z",codex-agent,"Pinned linked long-history limit regression passed 1/1 with zero failures/cancellations/skips/todos after the eviction-order correction. All three behavioral revert proofs are recorded: original assertTrustedChanges, clock rollback guards and receipt insertion order. Committing the corrected native engine, tests, contract and self-host archive before restarting npm and Bun full release gates."
  "2026-10-20T18:46:48.240Z",codex-agent,"Multi-ref retention refinement: an independent short root could be evicted while caching another requested long ancestry. Promote every requested tip after all checked ancestors, refreshing existing tip positions without exceeding the 4096-boundary cap. New regression uses 4097 signed commits plus an independent requested root. With only assertTrustedChanges as implemented at 6d8f545, node --test --test-name-pattern \"signature receipts bound\" test/signatures.test.ts fails 0/1 (warm multi-ref traversal expected zero visits, actual one). Both prior full gates were intentionally stopped before completion to include this correction; no test failures had been reported. This is the final retention correction before fresh full gates."
