  "2026-10-20T21:55:11.520Z",codex-agent,"All three findings fixed. PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6uiKGE: reject invalid/non-safe/pre-epoch effective-at before policy updates; regressions cover malformed/empty/out-of-range/pre-epoch inputs, byte-identical policy/config on refusal and valid epoch zero. PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6uiKGO: derive the invalid-key fixture control directory from the initialized repository, assert the precise key-validation error, no durable mutation on rejection and successful valid-key trust in that same repository. PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6uiKGa: count only failed signatures and list at most 20, preserving guidance and successful structured output. Test boundaries are 1, 20 and 21 failures mixed with a valid ancestor. The host truncates displayed errors, so tests also inspect the real registered handler diagnostic. Full-PR self-review found stale documentation claiming every row was listed; corrected that contract. No other instance of these defect classes found in native signing, publication, wire handling or changed tests. Dist remains ignored; thresholds and source inventory unchanged."
